msgid "当前平台交付边界"
msgstr "Current platform delivery boundaries"

msgid "当前重构将生产 SoC 收敛为 STM32F4，八个精确料号、七个器件视图和四个 F407 Board 包由系列入口维护。 全部 vendor 来源保留；Native 移到显式测试支撑。应用任务、产品策略和私有 PCB 继续由外部工程维护。"
msgstr "The refactor keeps STM32F4 as the production SoC. Its series entry maintains eight exact parts, seven device views and four F407 Board packages. All vendor sources remain retained; Native is explicit test support. External projects continue to own application tasks, product policy and private PCBs."

msgid "本页说明当前阅读与验收入口，不把源码存在、文档构建或历史软件结果写成本次通过。 默认 F407 路径的启动、停止、失败回滚、共享资源及诊断已由手写 C 维护，生成器负责 静态连接。后续主线是精确 F4 型号扩展、所需运行期能力和真实测量，按实际回归与源码 身份验收。当前物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。本轮已选软件范围的实际结果见下方固定 源码记录；文档更新不把这些结果转移到后续提交。"
msgstr "This page identifies current reading and acceptance entry points. Source presence, documentation builds and historical software results are not recorded as passes for this iteration. The default F407 startup, stop, failure rollback, shared resources and diagnostics are maintained in handwritten C; the generator provides static connections. Further work covers exact F4 parts, required runtime capabilities and physical measurements, accepted against actual regressions and source identity. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`. Actual results for this iteration's selected software scope are bound to the fixed source records below; documentation updates do not transfer those results to later commits."

msgid "主机配置统一由 `tools/configure/` 维护；配置代码不进入 MCU 镜像。"
msgstr "Host configuration is maintained in `tools/configure/`; its code is not linked into the MCU image."

